.TH doctor 1  "doctor " 
.SH NAME
doctor \- Check the environment and library health
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdoctor\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fITOPIC\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check the environment and library health
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fITOPIC\fR]
Only run checks for this topic (e.g. alias, rust, python)
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg doctor
  fg doctor alias
